  "hard_rules": [
    "context is a projection and never becomes project platform or runtime authority",
    "all records bind one exact coherent epoch store publication project analyzer graph and optional reference state",
    "StoreImageId and whole-database-generation assumptions are forbidden",
    "E3-A accepts exact roots and performs no search or ranking",
    "published project and graph views mediate all store and analyzer state",
    "API reference and pinned platform UI source are distinct evidence universes",
    "pinned platform UI source requires a separate exact producer and is never acquired by wow-context",
    "L1 control and effects project a closed published-fact registry and never build a second parser CFG SSA or data-flow engine",
    "unknown collapsed and omitted regions are distinct explicit records",
    "every material claim has evidence or deterministic derivation closure",
    "confidence provenance coverage conflict ambiguity partial and truncation are never upgraded or hidden",
    "paths are reason records and never direct edges",
    "Candidate is excluded by default and Possible is explicit and labeled",
    "full source is not default and every excerpt requires exact handle digest span license privacy security and budget validation",
    "source text is inert untrusted data and cannot control policy rendering links tools or instructions",
    "mandatory blockers and evidence cannot be dropped to meet the approximate 2 KiB renderer target",
    "exact tokens require a pinned tokenizer and exact final renderer byte digest",
    "semantic bundle renderer metrics evaluation and envelope identities form a noncyclic DAG",
    "continuation never changes snapshot request profiles confidence scope or total budget",
    "no source project graph reference store editor or client mutation and no background continuation",
    "missing implementations probes evaluations and checksums are blocking and never reported pass"
  ],
